\title "10. Two voices"
\ts (4 4)
0.1.4{txt "Tab view. 1. Press this 0, then N. 2. Press Alt+2: voice 2 is active (lit under Notes › Voice) and voice 1 turns grey. 3. Press the Down arrow key five times: the caret is on the low E string. 4. Press Shift+6, type 0, then Shift+Space, then type 3: two half notes under the melody, their stems down. 5. Press Alt+1: voice 1 is active again. 6. Press Esc."}
  3.1.4 1.2.4 0.1.4 |

